    // V3: chapters from the media helper at legacy positions (whole ms of
    // their starts), the chapter menu and its mark, VIDEO_NEXT_CHAPTER /
    // VIDEO_PREVIOUS_CHAPTER (M / N in the Video window) with prevchap; the
